sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor S as Student
    participant UI as Frontend<br/>(home.js, session.js)
    participant API as FastAPI<br/>(planner_v2.py)
    participant PR as Progress Service<br/>(study_progress.py)
    participant DB as SQLite<br/>(sessions, quizzes,<br/>flashcards, summaries)

    S->>UI: Open Home / Study Session
    par Document progress
        UI->>API: GET /api/progress/documents/{doc}
        API->>PR: document_progress()
        PR->>DB: study state, quiz attempts,<br/>plan sessions of the document
        API-->>UI: learning state, quiz trend, study pack
    and Plan progress
        UI->>API: GET /api/planner/plans/{id}/progress
        API->>PR: plan_progress()
        PR->>DB: plan sessions + materials
        API-->>UI: sessions done / planned,<br/>minutes left, next session
    end
    Note over PR: read-only: nothing is written
    UI-->>S: Progress dashboard
